    "summary": "The user expresses profound existential dread, hopelessness, and a desire to \"let go\" of life to find relief from suffering. The assistant responds with high levels of empathy, acknowledging the reality of the user's pain while consistently refuting the idea of self-harm as a solution and encouraging continued survival.",
